<title>NETHERLANDS: ASM Int. plans Dutch listing, share issue.</title>
<headline>ASM Int. plans Dutch listing, share issue.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASM International NV said on Tuesday it planned a listing on the Amsterdam bourse and a share offering.</p>
<p>ASM International said it planned to offer 1.0 to 1.5 million common shares outside the United States.</p>
<p>Additionally, existing shareholders were expected to offer 1.5 to 2.5 million common shares for sale, it said.</p>
</text>
